{"game": "helldivers-2", "language": "english", "appid": 553850, "month": "2024-08", "window": 4, "start_date": 1724457600, "end_date": 1725148799, "month_true_total": 10632, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 22:15:37 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "173939525", "author": {"steamid": "76561198013521424", "personaname": "Doc Halliday", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/thedocisinsane/", "num_games_owned": 756, "num_reviews": 14, "playtime_forever": 21515, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 1, "playtime_at_review": 11879, "last_played": 1787627241, "avatar": "9fa5f109a7ae3611b68f8ecfb382962a3f90c10e"}, "language": "english", "review": "The naysayers are gonna \"nay\" but this game has been an indisputable hit. Like many other communities, the loud minority makes a lot of complaints about the player base or the development team, but as a veteran of the first game, and loving the expansion to this new dimension, I can say for a fact that their complaints are moot. If you play the game to have fun, you will always find it. If you want a very challenging experience, it's there for you in the Suicidal and beyond modes. Want a more casual mission with friends where you can play around and just enjoy a horde shooter for what it is? Go for it. Maybe you're just here to tick off all the unlock boxes and get all the ship upgrades, and buddy, come join us at the table, that's my favorite too. \r\n\r\nThis game appeals to all, and with friends it is in a league of it's own. Arrowhead delivered an amazing live-service product that actually lives up the to hype and I will likely find myself playing for a long time to come.", "timestamp_created": 1725148787, "timestamp_updated": 1725148787, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 7, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.520426094532012939", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": f